doc_ref = "docs/design/characters.md §Recurring named NPCs: 'Gorrister Vale, a highwayman who preyed on pilgrims bound for the Stillmarsh - robbing the dying on their way to die. Seeds a Longroad banditry side quest.'"
notes = "HOME REGION IS TBD AND DELIBERATELY EMPTY. The bullet places this person's STORY (a Longroad side quest) and their release (WS_JUSTICE_UNBOUND, which is the Assize's own unbinding) in two different regions, and says where neither of them lives. Filling either in would be inventing canon, and world.md owns where people are; the side quest that uses him sets it. Suit, rank and anchors TBD for the same reason the Troupe's are."
